There are 3 ways to create a Variables
1. using let . We use let when we reassign and increment the var
2. using const. When we use const is if the variable wont chnage ie we are not incrementing or reassigning that case we use const varibale
const var2=5;
3. using var. We dont use var, because latest js it wont work
