Variable naming convention:
1. camelcase - twowords thilaga and dine - thilagaDine - Firstword all letter small and second word first letter caps. In java script almost everywhere we use this like naming variable etc. On naming variable dont use like c=5 ie too small or too big use medium sized variable name with camelcase
2. Pascal case - ThilagaDine - Both first letter caps, we use this in only one place in js
3.kebab-case - thilaga-dine - both are small with - inbetween we use this for name the files and on html
4. snake case - thilaga_dine - we use this in other programming languages

